<span class="line"><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#0184BC">    print</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#0184BC">list</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(my_func.map(</span><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#0184BC">range</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(</span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">3</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">), </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">return_exceptions</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">True</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">)))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="starmap">starmap</h2>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">starmap(</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#E45649">self</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, input_iterator, *, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">kwargs</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">={}, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">order_outputs</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">True</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">    return_exceptions</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">False</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">wrap_returned_exceptions</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">None</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Like <code>map</code>, but each input item is unpacked into multiple positional arguments.</p>
<p>Every element of <code>input_iterator</code> should be a sequence (for example a tuple) with length equal to the
arity of the function.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">input_iterator</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm">typing.Iterable[typing.Sequence[Any]]</span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">Iterable of argument tuples to unpack into each call. </div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">kwargs</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm"></span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">Extra keyword arguments forwarded to every invocation. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">{}</span>)</span></div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">order_outputs</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm">bool</span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">If True, preserve input order in outputs; if False, use completion order. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">True</span>)</span></div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">return_exceptions</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm">bool</span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">If True, failed inputs appear as exceptions in the result stream instead of raising. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">False</span>)</span></div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">wrap_returned_exceptions</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm">bool | None</span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">Deprecated; no longer has any effect. </div></div>
<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2">@app.function</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#A626A4">def</span><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2"> my_func</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(</span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">a</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">,</span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801"> b</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#C586C0;--shiki-light:#A626A4">    return</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42"> a + b</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2">@app.local_entrypoint</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#A626A4">def</span><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2"> main</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#C586C0;--shiki-light:#A626A4">    assert</span><span style="color:#4EC9B0;--shiki-light:#0184BC"> list</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(my_func.starmap([(</span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">1</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, </span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">2</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">), (</span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">3</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, </span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">4</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">)])) == [</span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">3</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, </span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">7</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="for_each">for_each</h2>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">for_each(</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#E45649">self</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, *input_iterators, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">kwargs</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">={}, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">ignore_exceptions</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">=</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801">False</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Execute the function for all inputs and wait for completion, discarding return values.</p>
<p>Like <code>.map()</code> but you do not need to iterate the result to drive work—Modal processes every input.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">*input_iterators</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm"></span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">One iterator per mapped positional parameter on the function. </div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">kwargs</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm"></span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">Extra keyword arguments forwarded to every invocation. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">{}</span>)</span></div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">ignore_exceptions</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm">bool</span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">If True, failures are swallowed instead of propagating. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">False</span>)</span></div></div>
<h2 id="spawn_map">spawn_map</h2>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">spawn_map(</span><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#E45649">self</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">, *input_iterators, </span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">kwargs</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">={})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spawn parallel execution over a set of inputs, exiting as soon as the inputs are created (without waiting
for the map to complete).</p>
<p>Takes one iterator argument per argument in the function being mapped over.</p>
<p>Programmatic retrieval of results will be supported in a future update.</p>
<p><strong>Parameters</strong></p>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">*input_iterators</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm"></span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">One iterator per mapped positional parameter on the function. </div></div>
<div class="bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="font-mono font-medium">kwargs</span><span class="text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm"></span></div><div class="description my-2 ml-4">Extra keyword arguments forwarded to every invocation. <span class="text-tertiary text-sm">(Default is <span class="bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono">{}</span>)</span></div></div>
<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>
<div class="runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light" style="background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2">@app.function</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#A626A4">def</span><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2"> my_func</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">(</span><span style="color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801">a</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#C586C0;--shiki-light:#A626A4">    return</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42"> a ** </span><span style="color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801">2</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#DCDCAA;--shiki-light:#4078F2">@app.local_entrypoint</span><span style="color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42">()</span></span>
