 style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#CE9178;--shiki-light:#50A14F\">\"\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\u003Ch3 id=\"logstail\">logs.tail\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"runtime-reference-code dual-theme not-prose my-6\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes dark-plus one-light\" style=\"background-color:#1E1E1E;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">tail(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#E45649\">self\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801\">entries\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B5CEA8;--shiki-light:#986801\">100\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">, *, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9CDCFE;--shiki-light:#986801\">source\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#569CD6;--shiki-light:#986801\">None\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D4D4D4;--shiki-light:#383A42\">)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\u003Cp>Fetch the most recent Function logs.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Parameters\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"bg-overlay mb-2 rounded-md px-4 py-2\">\u003Cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\u003Cspan class=\"font-mono font-medium\">entries\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"text-tertiary bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px-1 py-px font-mono text-sm\">int\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"description my-2 ml-4\">The number of log entries to return. \u003Cspan class=\"text-tertiary text-sm\">(Default is \u003Cspan class=\"bg-secondary-disabled rounded-md px